ation game. Return to Star Island and h\u0336\u0313\u0349e\u0334\u034a\u032dl\u0336\u0309\u0358\u0319p\u0335\u0302\u033c your grandmother in re-collecting her missing research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve various puzzles around the island to capture photographs of creatures and friendly citizens. Record your findings and s\u0337\u0350\u0324a\u0335\u0311\u0319v\u0338\u034c\u033be\u0337\u0309\u0328 your pictures in your very own research journal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>This free demo contains a preview of Snap Quest limited to the opening Boogie Bay zone.</strong><br><br>Rebuild t\u0336\u0344h\u0338\u0346\u0319e\u0335\u031a\u031f i\u0335\u0350\u033as\u0336\u0310\u0333l\u0336\u031b\u0330a\u0338\u0344\u0345n\u0334\u030c\u0353d\u0335\u0309\u0329 by completing scientific studies and collecting research grants. Befriend the small island community and make it prosper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744980/extras/0b13590326bdb65e5e62961e4b9e342c.poster.avif?t=1752261555\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744980/extras/0b13590326bdb65e5e62961e4b9e342c.webp?t=1752261555\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your Camera to document your findings! Find and upgrade camera components to uncover lost scientific discoveries!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744980/extras/5324b5fa8e936de3e363ab5048d602e4.poster.avif?t=1752261555\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744980/extras/5324b5fa8e936de3e363ab5048d602e4.webp?t=1752261555\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\">